#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
generate_bpmn.py — Convert v4 extraction.json into BPMN 2.0 process maps.

Generates a 3-level hierarchy:
  Level 0: process-map.html (landscape — stage cards)
  Level 1: processes/{stage}/index.html (stage overview — sub-process cards)
  Level 2: processes/{stage}/{id}.bpmn + .html (BPMN viewer per sub-process)

Layout is handled by ELK.js (Node.js) — orthogonal routing with lane-aware positioning.

Usage:
    python3 generate_bpmn.py --client-slug <client-slug>
"""

